  ⚠️ WHAT THIS DOES NOT SAY. That the ordering carries measurable information is NOT
     that B should replace A. On CRPS against A, B LOSES by +8.52 (S5 #584 §2b) and
     even the oracle only ties A. The promotion criterion is S6 #585's, and it is VOID.
